U1 — YouTube "Recommended upload encoding settings"
URL:       https://support.google.com/youtube/answer/1722171?hl=en
Read:      2026-11-10 (WP11 builder, via WebFetch; page shows no last-updated date, footer (c)2026 Google)

Container: MP4, no edit lists, moov atom at the front (fast start)
Audio:     AAC-LC (or Opus / Eclipsa Audio); stereo (or stereo + 5.1); 48 kHz; stereo bitrate 384 kbps
Video:     H.264, progressive, High Profile, 2 consecutive B-frames, closed GOP of half the frame rate,
           CABAC, variable bitrate (no limit required; table is a reference), chroma 4:2:0
Frame rate: encode/upload at the recorded frame rate (24, 25, 30, 48, 50, 60 common)
SDR 1080p bitrate: 8 Mbps at 24/25/30 fps; 12 Mbps at 48/50/60 fps

